  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introduction of an Environmentally Sound Management and Disposal System of PCB Wastes and PCB-Contaminated Equipment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to (a) introduce and implement a PCB management system to reduce and/or eliminate releases from PCB wastes stockpiles and PCB-containing equipment and (b) dispose of at least 3,000 tonnes of PCBs wastes and PCB-containing equipment in an environmentally-sound manner maximizing opportunities for public-private partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
